==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*8 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*2 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*4 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Master A.]] spawns as the boss after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage's magnifications are pitifully low, meaning it is easily completable with Normal and Special cats without true forms and at low level (20).

Simply bring two meatshields for defense, some midrangers like [[Actress Cat (Special Cat)|Actress Cats]] or melee units like [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Mythical Titan Cat]] and [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]] to handle the peons, and [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|True Valkyrie Cat]]/[[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] for the Master A.

